  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building justice and peace through COMMUNITY WELLBEING in Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COMMUNITY WELLBEING emphasizes on psychosocial support services and safe spaces for the youth, including youth with disabilities and internally displaced youth. Through this, survivors of SGBV, substance abuse, and war will acquire positive coping mechanisms for increasing their resilience.</narrative>
  </description>
